Beautifully presented over three floors, 8 Catherines Place was built in 2017 and represents a stunning family home finished to an exceptional standard.

The kitchen/breakfast room is filled with natural light from the skylights and there is access outside through the bi fold doors. The ground floor is underfloor heated, and the kitchen is fully fitted with integrated Siemens appliances and stone worktops. There is a comfortable living room with large windows and a cloakroom off of the entrance hall. Both the kitchen, and the bathrooms, are designed by Porcelanosa.

