Set over two floors and significantly extended in 2014, this Cooks built home offers versatile living accommodation and benefits from three reception rooms, conservatory, as well as a generous re-fitted kitchen/dining/living room, utility room and a W.C. Upstairs there are four well-proportioned bedrooms with the primary suite benefitting from a 3 double wardrobes, en-suite shower room and stunning views of the garden.

Outside Space
At the rear there is a large, raised deck area with storage underneath and a generous mature garden, mostly laid to lawn with bed borders and fruit trees. In addition, the property boasts 3 x solar panels and a large wooden shed.

