This exclusive new development of just 38 industrial, warehouse-style apartments occupies a prime position in vibrant London Fields, E8.

Smokehaus offers residents a sanctuary in the heart of London Fields, with an array of best-in-class amenities including concierge and bicycle storage. Taking its cues from its architectural surroundings, with large windows and an industrial chic feel which, coupled with the carefully considered interiors, reflects the urban feel synonymous with Hackney.

1 and 2 bedroom apartments available from £600,000.

Location

Located in bustling London Fields, the heart of Hackney’s creative community, with Broadway Market and a buzzing High Street with a plethora of independent restaurants, cafes and bars.

Benefitting from multiple nearby green open spaces such as London Fields and Victoria Park, Smokehaus occupies a prominent position in the heart of Hackney.

Ease of access across London is provided from nearby transport links such as London Fields Overground (0.1 miles), Cambridge Heath Overground (0.5 miles) and Bethnal Green Underground (0.9 miles).

