Perfectly positioned in one of Clapton’s most desirable locations, the penthouse is just moments from the River Lea, with scenic towpaths ideal for walking, running, and cycling. Millfields Park is on your doorstep, providing green spaces, sports facilities, and shaded areas for relaxing. Hackney Marshes and Walthamstow Marshes are nearby, offering access to some of East London’s finest natural landscapes.

