The property boasts three generously sized bedrooms, providing ample space for a growing family or the flexibility to create a home office or guest room. The master bedroom benefits from an en-suite bathroom, adding a touch of convenience and privacy. A further family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms, both fitted with modern fixtures and a clean, contemporary design.

